            0.088,
            0.847,
            0.147
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "？ Net of a sphere? Experiment and see if you can make a paper cutout that can perfectly wrap around a ball without leaving any wrinkles, gaps or overlaps."
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.166,
            0.456,
            0.187
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Shortest Paths on a Cube"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.197,
            0.847,
            0.289
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Let us consider an interesting problem related to the discussion so far. We know that on a plane, the shortest path between two points is the straight line between them. Now, what is the shortest path between two points on the surface of a cuboid, if we are allowed to travel only along its surface?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.289,
            0.846,
            0.328
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Let us imagine a hungry ant living on the surface of a cuboid. To its good fortune, there is a laddu on the surface."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.418,
            0.337,
            0.688,
            0.355
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Laddu",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " (at the centre of the top face)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.56,
            0.412,
            0.814,
            0.432
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Ant",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " (at the centre of the side face)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.511,
            0.698,
            0.535
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "？ What is the shortest path for the ant to reach the laddu?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.547,
            0.488,
            0.571
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "？ What about in the following case?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.813,
            0.492,
            0.903,
