            0.109,
            0.746,
            0.847,
            0.788
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "？ If we think that a certain path is the shortest, how can we be sure that it truly is, among all the infinite possibilities?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.111,
            0.792,
            0.644,
            0.817
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "For example, are either of these the shortest path?"
